title: "Declared versus measured uncertainty: 50 declarations, their verification records and a correction ledger"
abstract: >-
  An audit of 50 published uncertainty declarations across 16 Earth-system variable families, with a five-condition admission checklist, 55 verification records and a 17-row correction ledger.
